llowing dictionary attribute","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/table-administration-and-data-management/t_ModifyADictionaryEntryFromAForm.md","line":73},{"title":"Add the following system property","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/t_AddAPropertyUsingSysPropsList.md","line":102},{"title":"add the following dictionary attribute","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/table-administration-and-data-management/t_ModifyADictionaryEntryFromAForm.md","line":130},{"title":"Add the following system property","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/t_AddAPropertyUsingSysPropsList.md","line":157},{"title":"add the following dictionary attribute","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/table-administration-and-data-management/t_ModifyADictionaryEntryFromAForm.md","line":177},{"title":"Add the following system property","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/t_AddAPropertyUsingSysPropsList.md","line":204},{"title":"add the following dictionary attribute","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/table-administration-and-data-management/t_ModifyADictionaryEntryFromAForm.md","line":224},{"title":"Add","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/t_AddAPropertyUsingSysPropsList.md","line":271},{"title":"Add","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/t_AddAPropertyUsingSysPropsList.md","line":283},{"title":"user record","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/user-administration/t_CreateAUser.md","line":296},{"title":"Add","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/t_AddAPropertyUsingSysPropsList.md","line":298},{"title":"Add","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/t_AddAPropertyUsingSysPropsList.md","line":308},{"title":"Add","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/t_AddAPropertyUsingSysPropsList.md","line":326},{"title":"Add","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/t_AddAPropertyUsingSysPropsList.md","line":336},{"title":"Add a system property","target":"t_AddAPropertyUsingSysPropsList","line":416},{"title":"System properties","target":"r_SetArchiveRuleProcessingBehavior","line":417}],"metadata":{"title":"E.164 phone number field configuration","description":"Administrators can use the phone number system properties and dictionary attributes to do certain things.By default, phone number fields require that a phone number match the display format of the selected territory.By default, users can enter phone numbers in their territory's local format and do not have to format the number for international dialing.By default, an E.164 phone number field always displays phone numbers in an international format.A property controls how territory labels are displayed.A property is available to control the display of prefixes.By default, an E.164 phone number field always displays the phone territory that is associated with the phone number.Several properties are available to configure E.164 phone number fields.You can override the global system property with certain dictionary attributes.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/platform-administration/r\\_ConfigureE.164PhoneNumberFields.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"reference","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":11,"breadcrumb":["Phone number field type","Reference","Field administration","Forms","fields","and lists","Configure core features","Administer the ServiceNow AI Platform"],"tags":["#platform-administration","#type-reference"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/platform-administration/r_ConfigureE.164PhoneNumberFields.md"},
